WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.979
I finished school at sixteen. The disease had already

00:00:03.979 --> 00:00:07.344
interrupted my last year, and my examination results

00:00:07.344 --> 00:00:10.320
closed the medical school path I had expected.

00:00:15.675 --> 00:00:19.260
During severe attacks I could not always keep down

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:19.547
even

00:00:19.547 --> 00:00:23.208
water. Laboratory eosinophil counts became numbers I

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:25.742
learned to anticipate from the pain.

00:00:31.258 --> 00:00:34.822
One week before a trip to the United States, an actual

00:00:34.822 --> 00:00:37.528
flare led to an endoscopy and a course of

00:00:37.528 --> 00:00:40.762
glucocorticoids. It was not preventive treatment.

00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:49.462
Clinical uncertainty turned into an accumulation of

00:00:49.462 --> 00:00:52.684
medications, tests, missed days and attempts to

00:00:52.684 --> 00:00:55.289
understand what my own body was doing.

00:01:00.425 --> 00:01:03.762
I learned to investigate cells and materials while

00:01:03.762 --> 00:01:04.162
living

00:01:04.162 --> 00:01:07.636
with a disease whose symptoms could overwhelm even an

00:01:07.636 --> 00:01:08.488
ordinary day.

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:16.821
The essay asks what disappears when a patient's life

00:01:16.821 --> 00:01:16.966
is

00:01:16.966 --> 00:01:20.313
reduced to a diagnostic label or a test result.
